# Fblthp, Impossibly Lost: "When one or more of your opponents are dealt combat damage during your turn, draw two cards.
# If your library has no cards in it, you win the game. Fblthp's owner shuffles him into their library." Bot1 casts
# Fblthp and attacks with it on the next turn; the combat damage to Bot2 triggers the ability (CR 510.2, 603.2c), which
# draws two cards and then shuffles Fblthp into Bot1's library (CR 701.24a), so he is no longer on the battlefield and
# the library has one card more than the two draws took from it. The library is not empty, so nothing is won.

